ira, the only son of a magic store, with his previous life's memories. He had no talent for swordsmanship or magic, but he didn’t care as he was still loved by his family. At one point, he realized that he can embody various things by \"drawing a picture\". That's when he noticed his cheat ability...!?","year":2021,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Romance","Adventure","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy","Tragedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/05a56be4-26ab-4f50-8fc0-ab8304570258/94f85031-01fa-4311-a999-7f8e2d9561f7.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["fr","vi","en","es-la","pt-br"],"lane":"manga","rating":7.55,"follows":55063,"listAt":"2026-10-20T13:03:24.451Z","chapters":[{"id":"6837de81-276b-49e1-8475-9358eacddcf9","number":"205","volume":null,"title":"Clouds of War Part 2","lang":"en","pages":18,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T16:03:56+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"29580f1c-2f1f-4997-9ce5-c05e450c9f19","number":"204","volume":null,"title":"Clouds of War Part 1","lang":"en","pages":14,"createdAt":"2026-10-17T16:03:37+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"9c76aff2-f3de-4d9c-b0c1-0c7d6a8d334b","number":"203","volume":null,"title":"Melaria of The End","lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T14:59:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7a1b7904-6a94-4345-aa4d-33469820c7ba","number":"202","volume":null,"title":"Friendly Conversation","lang":"en","pages":18,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T14:58:49+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"dbb70542-e033-4107-9d86-c79a920de9d7","number":"201","volume":null,"title":"A Medicine that Restores a Person's Condition","lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2026-09-26T14:58:17+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"286090de-fa34-45ed-8d47-fab1649086df","number":"200","volume":null,"title":"The Promised Field","lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2026-08-14T13:23:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"10772825-ade0-48c3-804e-4c0b7bc945ef","number":"199","volume":null,"title":"The Predetermined Choice","lang"